#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:1
msgid "The Public Path Table"
msgstr "公开路径表"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:3
msgid ""
"HybridInference runs two HTTP services: the FastAPI gateway "
"(`apps/backend`) and the Next.js console (`apps/frontend`). Only the "
"console needs to be reachable from the internet."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference 运行两个 HTTP 服务：FastAPI 网关（`apps/backend`）和 Next.js "
"控制台（`apps/frontend`）。只有控制台需要能从互联网访问。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:7
msgid ""
"`deploy/public-paths.json` is the public path table. It lists every "
"public path that is not one of the console's own pages, and what serves "
"it. The console implements it: route handlers forward the gateway's "
"paths, static rewrites in `apps/frontend/next.config.js` forward a few "
"that only answer `GET`, and the cloud agent and pgAdmin have route "
"handlers of their own. Every other path is one of the console's pages."
msgstr ""
"`deploy/public-paths.json` "
"就是公开路径表。它列出所有不属于控制台自身页面的公开路径，以及由谁提供服务。控制台负责实现它：route handler "
"转发网关的路径，`apps/frontend/next.config.js` 中的静态 rewrite 转发少数只响应 `GET` "
"的路径，cloud agent 和 pgAdmin 各有自己的 route handler。其余所有路径都是控制台的页面。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:24
msgid ""
"Exposing the console's port therefore exposes every gateway path in the "
"table. To publish a new path, add it to the manifest and to the console; "
"the reverse proxy or tunnel in front does not change. A path missing from"
" the console gets its HTML 404 page, which an API client reads as \"the "
"gateway is down\"."
msgstr ""
"因此，暴露控制台的端口就暴露了表中所有的网关路径。要发布新路径，把它加到清单和控制台中即可；前面的反向代理或隧道不需要改动。控制台中没有的路径会得到它的"
" HTML 404 页面，API 客户端会把这理解为“网关挂了”。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:29
msgid ""
"A deployment's entry (its CDN, tunnel or load balancer) may send the "
"paths marked `entry_split`, `/v1` and `/anthropic`, straight to the "
"gateway, so that a console release or restart does not interrupt "
"inference. That choice belongs to the deployment's entry; this repository"
" ships no entry configuration. [Splitting inference traffic at the "
"entry](deployment.md#splitting-inference-traffic-at-the-entry) lists the "
"conditions an entry must meet."
msgstr ""
"部署的入口（CDN、隧道或负载均衡器）可以把标记为 `entry_split` 的路径，即 `/v1` 和 "
"`/anthropic`，直接发给网关，这样控制台的发布或重启就不会中断推理。这由部署的入口自行决定；本仓库不提供任何入口配置。入口必须满足的条件见[在入口拆分推理流量](deployment.md"
"#splitting-inference-traffic-at-the-entry)。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:36
msgid ""
"The console keeps forwarding those prefixes either way, so removing the "
"entry's rules sends the traffic back through it, and a new route under a "
"split prefix needs no entry change. Adding or moving a split prefix does "
"change the entry, and the [probe](deployment.md#checking-an-entry-split-"
"with-the-probe) must run again."
msgstr ""
"无论如何，控制台都会继续转发这些前缀，所以删除入口的规则就会让流量重新经过控制台，而分流前缀下的新路由也不需要修改入口。新增或移动分流前缀则需要修改入口，并且必须重新运行[探针](deployment.md"
"#checking-an-entry-split-with-the-probe)。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:42
msgid "The manifest"
msgstr "清单"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:44
msgid "Each entry of `deploy/public-paths.json` has four fields:"
msgstr "`deploy/public-paths.json` 的每个条目有四个字段："

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`path`"
msgstr "`path`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"The public path. A segment written `:name` stands for any one segment: "
"`/internal/users/:userId/status`"
msgstr "公开路径。写作 `:name` 的一段代表任意一段：`/internal/users/:userId/status`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`match`"
msgstr "`match`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"`prefix`: the path itself or anything below it, so `/v1` covers `/v1` and"
" `/v1/...` but not `/v10`. `exact`: the path alone. Both are judged after"
" dot segments are resolved, as the console's `isUnder()` judges them"
msgstr ""
"`prefix`：路径本身或它下面的任何路径，因此 `/v1` 覆盖 `/v1` 和 `/v1/...`，但不覆盖 "
"`/v10`。`exact`：仅路径本身。两者都在解析点号路径段之后判断，与控制台的 `isUnder()` 判断方式相同"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`owner`"
msgstr "`owner`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"What serves it: `gateway`, `console` (a route handler of the console's "
"own, such as `/healthz` and `/site-assets`), `cloud-agent` or `pgadmin`"
msgstr ""
"由谁提供：`gateway`、`console`（控制台自己的 route handler，例如 `/healthz` 和 `/site-"
"assets`）、`cloud-agent` 或 `pgadmin`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid "`entry_split`"
msgstr "`entry_split`"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md
msgid ""
"`true` when a deployment's entry may send the path straight to the "
"gateway. Only `/v1` and `/anthropic` are"
msgstr "为 `true` 时，部署的入口可以把该路径直接交给网关。只有 `/v1` 和 `/anthropic` 是"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:53
msgid ""
"A gateway path that is not in the manifest must not be reachable from the"
" internet: FastAPI's `/docs`, `/redoc` and `/openapi.json`, "
"`/health/deep`, `/health/ready`, `/health/model-activity`, and every "
"`/internal` route not listed. The console forwards none of them, and an "
"entry that splits off a prefix must keep them out too (rules E1 and E7 in"
" the deployment guide)."
msgstr ""
"不在清单中的网关路径绝不能从互联网访问：FastAPI 的 `/docs`、`/redoc` 和 "
"`/openapi.json`，`/health/deep`、`/health/ready`、`/health/model-"
"activity`，以及所有未列出的 `/internal` "
"路由。控制台不转发其中任何一个；拆分出某个前缀的入口也必须把它们挡在外面（部署指南中的规则 E1 和 E7）。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:59
msgid ""
"The console's routing cannot read the manifest: route handlers are files,"
" `rewrites()` and `redirects()` are compiled at build time, and the "
"middleware's `matcher` must be a literal. Tests hold each of them to the "
"manifest and fail when one changes without the others:"
msgstr ""
"控制台的路由机制无法读取清单：route handler 是文件，`rewrites()` 和 `redirects()` "
"在构建时编译，而中间件的 `matcher` 必须是字面量。因此由测试把它们逐一与清单对齐，任何一个单独改变时测试都会失败："

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:64
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/next.config.public-paths.test.ts` checks that each gateway"
" entry is served by one route handler or one rewrite, that the "
"middleware's `matcher` leaves out the manifest's first segments, and that"
" the trailing-slash rule in `redirects()` covers the right segments. "
"`/healthz` is the one manifest path the middleware still sees."
msgstr ""
"`apps/frontend/next.config.public-paths.test.ts` 检查每个网关条目都恰好由一个 route "
"handler 或一条 rewrite 提供服务，中间件的 `matcher` 排除了清单中的所有首段，并且 `redirects()` "
"中的尾斜杠规则覆盖了正确的路径段。`/healthz` 是唯一仍会经过中间件的清单路径。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:69
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/src/lib/server/gatewayRoutes.test.ts` checks the gateway "
"route files against the manifest."
msgstr "`apps/frontend/src/lib/server/gatewayRoutes.test.ts` 把网关的 route 文件与清单对照检查。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:71
msgid ""
"`tests/unit/middleware/test_trailing_slash.py` checks that the gateway's "
"own trailing-slash redirect covers the `entry_split` prefixes."
msgstr ""
"`tests/unit/middleware/test_trailing_slash.py` 检查网关自己的尾斜杠重定向覆盖了 "
"`entry_split` 前缀。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:74
msgid ""
"The rewrites, the redirect rule and the matcher work per first segment "
"(`internal`, not `/internal/verify-admin`). The route files, one per "
"path, decide which `/internal` paths are published."
msgstr ""
"rewrite、重定向规则和 matcher 都按首段工作（是 `internal`，而不是 `/internal/verify-"
"admin`）。哪些 `/internal` 路径公开，由每个路径各自的 route 文件决定。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:78
msgid "The path table"
msgstr "路径表"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:80
msgid ""
"Two manifest paths are the console's own and reach nothing behind it: "
"`/healthz`, the container health check (`src/app/healthz/route.ts`), "
"which answers `200 ok` without asking the gateway, and `/site-assets`, "
"the Site UI module's images (`src/app/site-assets/[[...path]]/route.ts`)."
" `/health` is the gateway's check, forwarded."
msgstr ""
"有两个清单路径属于控制台自己，不会到达它后面的任何服务：`/healthz` "
"是容器健康检查（`src/app/healthz/route.ts`），不询问网关直接返回 `200 ok`；`/site-assets` 是 "
"Site UI 模块的图片（`src/app/site-assets/[[...path]]/route.ts`）。`/health` "
"是网关的健康检查，经转发提供。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:86
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/next.config.js` is the source of truth for rewrites, and "
"each `route.ts` for its handler. Next resolves rewrites at build time, "
"into `.next/routes-manifest.json`. Route handlers read their server-only "
"environment at request time, so changing their targets needs a recreated "
"container, not a new image."
msgstr ""
"rewrite 以 `apps/frontend/next.config.js` 为准，每个 handler 以各自的 `route.ts` "
"为准。Next 在构建时解析 rewrite，写入 `.next/routes-manifest.json`。route handler "
"在请求时读取仅服务端可见的环境变量，因此修改它们的目标只需重建容器，不需要新镜像。"

