#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:99
msgid ""
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` is fixed when the console image is built. The same"
" value goes into the rewrites and into the server-only "
"`BUILT_BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` that the gateway's route handlers, `/site-"
"config` and pgAdmin's admin check use, so a runtime override cannot send "
"only some backend requests elsewhere. The published image uses "
"`http://backend:8080`, so the backend must have that network name; "
"another address means rebuilding the console."
msgstr ""
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` 在构建控制台镜像时固定下来。同一个值既写入 rewrite，也写入仅服务端可见的 "
"`BUILT_BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`，后者供网关的 route handler、`/site-config` 和 "
"pgAdmin 的管理员检查使用，因此运行时覆盖无法只把一部分后端请求发到别处。发布的镜像使用 "
"`http://backend:8080`，所以后端必须使用这个网络名；换成其他地址就需要重新构建控制台。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:106
msgid "The cloud agent proxy"
msgstr "cloud agent 代理"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:108
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/src/app/agents/[[...path]]/route.ts` reads both agent "
"targets on every request. With either one unset, `/agents` answers 404; "
"an invalid target or an unreachable service answers 502."
msgstr ""
"`apps/frontend/src/app/agents/[[...path]]/route.ts` 在每个请求上读取两个 agent "
"目标。任何一个未设置时，`/agents` 返回 404；目标无效或服务不可达时返回 502。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:112
msgid ""
"For an agent on its own hostname, set `AGENT_PUBLIC_URL` to its public "
"HTTPS URL (without credentials). The dashboard's Agents tile, shown only "
"to internal users, then links there, whatever the proxy targets are. "
"Without it, the tile links to `/agents` only when both proxy targets are "
"set. Unlike the private targets, the public URL is sent to the browser in"
" the site configuration."
msgstr ""
"如果 agent 有自己的主机名，请把 `AGENT_PUBLIC_URL` 设为它的公开 HTTPS "
"URL（不含凭据）。控制台首页上只对内部用户显示的 Agents "
"卡片随后会链接到那里，与代理目标无关。没有设置它时，只有两个代理目标都设置了，卡片才会链接到 `/agents`。与私有目标不同，公开 URL "
"会随站点配置发送到浏览器。"

