#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:124
msgid ""
"`/agents/api/:path*` is matched before `/agents/:path*`. In the other "
"order, every API call would get the web app's HTML."
msgstr ""
"`/agents/api/:path*` 先于 `/agents/:path*` 匹配。如果顺序反过来，每个 API 调用都会得到 web 应用的"
" HTML。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:126
msgid ""
"The handler streams request and response bodies, SSE included, but cannot"
" accept WebSocket upgrades. A WebSocket endpoint would need an upgrade-"
"aware proxy in front of Next.js."
msgstr ""
"handler 以流式方式转发请求体和响应体，包括 SSE，但无法接受 WebSocket 升级。WebSocket 端点需要在 Next.js "
"前面放一个支持升级的代理。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:129
msgid ""
"Hop-by-hop headers are removed, and redirects that name either internal "
"service are folded back through the public prefix. The agent's own "
"cookies pass both ways; the console's session cookie is never forwarded "
"to it. A cookie the agent sets under one of the console's names is "
"dropped, and the rest are confined to `/agents` (a `__Host-` cookie keeps"
" the `Path=/` that browsers require of it)."
msgstr ""
"逐跳头部会被去掉，指向任一内部服务的重定向会被改写回公开前缀。agent 自己的 cookie 双向传递；控制台的会话 cookie "
"绝不会转发给它。agent 用控制台的某个 cookie 名设置的 cookie 会被丢弃，其余的被限定在 `/agents` "
"下（`__Host-` cookie 保留浏览器要求它必须有的 `Path=/`）。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:136
msgid "Gateway route handlers"
msgstr "网关的 route handler"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:138
msgid ""
"Every gateway path that takes a request body is forwarded by a route "
"handler, not a rewrite. Next keeps a copy of every rewritten request body"
" in memory until the request ends, and stops copying at "
"`middlewareClientMaxBodySize`, so a rewrite either cuts a large body "
"short or lets any caller pin that much console memory per request. A "
"route handler streams the body to the gateway and holds none of it."
msgstr ""
"所有带请求体的网关路径都由 route handler 转发，而不是 rewrite。Next 会在内存中保留每个被 rewrite "
"的请求体的副本，直到请求结束，并在达到 `middlewareClientMaxBodySize` 时停止复制，所以 rewrite "
"要么截断大的请求体，要么让任何调用方每个请求都占用这么多控制台内存。route handler 把请求体以流式方式转发给网关，自己一点都不保留。"

