#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:162
msgid ""
"Each published `/internal` path has a route file of its own. The prefix "
"is shared with `/internal/verify-admin`, which authenticates a browser "
"session by cookie, so a catch-all would publish whatever route lands "
"under `/internal` next without anyone deciding it should be public. "
"`/internal/agent-grants` is the one sub-prefix published whole, because "
"every route on that router requires the dispatch token."
msgstr ""
"每个公开的 `/internal` 路径都有自己的 route 文件。这个前缀与 `/internal/verify-admin` "
"共用，而后者通过 cookie 认证浏览器会话，因此通配的 handler 会把以后出现在 `/internal` "
"下的任何路由都公开出去，而没有人决定过它应该公开。`/internal/agent-grants` 是唯一整体公开的子前缀，因为该 router "
"上的每个路由都要求 dispatch token。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:169
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each handler forwards to `${BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL}` plus the same path, if"
" that path, with its dot segments resolved, is still under the handler's "
"prefix; anything else gets a 404. The forwarding code is "
"`src/lib/server/gatewayProxy.ts`. Unlike a rewrite, the handler:"
msgstr ""
"每个 handler 把请求转发到 `${BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL}` 加上相同路径，前提是该路径在解析点号路径段之后仍位于 "
"handler 的前缀之下；其他情况一律返回 404。转发代码在 `src/lib/server/gatewayProxy.ts`。与 "
"rewrite 不同，handler 会："

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:174
msgid ""
"ends the caller's response when the gateway drops the connection after "
"the response has started (a crash, a restart or a deploy). A rewrite "
"leaves the caller waiting until something in front of the console gives "
"up;"
msgstr "在响应开始后网关断开连接时（崩溃、重启或部署），结束调用方的响应。rewrite 会让调用方一直等下去，直到控制台前面的某个组件放弃；"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:177
msgid ""
"sets no deadline of its own, where a rewrite ends a response after 30 "
"seconds without data. The gateway limits every request, and streams send "
"a keepalive every 15 seconds; the handler only closes a connection that "
"has carried nothing in either direction for an hour;"
msgstr ""
"不设置自己的截止时间，而 rewrite 在 30 秒没有数据后就会结束响应。网关会限制每个请求，流式响应每 15 秒发送一次保活；handler"
" 只关闭在两个方向上一小时都没有任何数据的连接；"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:181
msgid ""
"answers a gateway it cannot reach with a JSON 502, not Next's plain-text "
"500."
msgstr "在连不上网关时返回 JSON 格式的 502，而不是 Next 的纯文本 500。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:183
msgid ""
"The gateway receives every request header except the hop-by-hop ones, "
"with `Host` set to the gateway and the caller's host in `X-Forwarded-"
"Host`; the handler frames the body itself. The caller's own `X-Forwarded-"
"For` reaches the gateway unchanged, with no address added; Next fills in "
"`X-Forwarded-For`, `-Proto` and `-Port` from the connection only when the"
" caller sent none. Read [Behind the console](trusted-proxies-and-client-"
"ips.md#behind-the-console) before trusting them. When the caller hangs "
"up, the gateway's request is cancelled at once."
msgstr ""
"网关会收到除逐跳头部以外的所有请求头，其中 `Host` 设为网关，调用方的主机放在 `X-Forwarded-Host` 中；请求体的分帧由 "
"handler 自己负责。调用方自己的 `X-Forwarded-For` 原样到达网关，不追加任何地址；只有当调用方完全没有发送时，Next "
"才根据连接填入 `X-Forwarded-For`、`-Proto` 和 `-Port`。在信任它们之前，请阅读[控制台之后](trusted-"
"proxies-and-client-ips.md#behind-the-console)。调用方挂断时，网关上的请求会立即取消。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:192
msgid "Gateway rewrites (`afterFiles`)"
msgstr "网关的 rewrite（`afterFiles`）"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:194
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"These paths only answer `GET`, so a rewrite has no body to copy; Next "
"keeps at most `middlewareClientMaxBodySize` (16 KiB) of anything a caller"
" sends anyway. Each destination is `${BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL}` plus the "
"same path."
msgstr ""
"这些路径只响应 `GET`，所以 rewrite 没有请求体可复制；即使调用方发送了内容，Next 最多也只保留 "
"`middlewareClientMaxBodySize`（16 KiB）。每个目标都是 `${BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL}` "
"加上相同路径。"

