#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:207
msgid "Why `/pgadmin` is a route handler and not a rewrite"
msgstr "为什么 `/pgadmin` 是 route handler 而不是 rewrite"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:209
msgid ""
"pgAdmin must be reachable by admins only, and a rewrite cannot "
"authenticate: it is a static mapping applied before any of your code "
"runs. So `/pgadmin` is an app route, "
"`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`, which wins over "
"`afterFiles` rewrites and proxies to pgAdmin after checking the caller. "
"Its choices apply to any authenticated proxy written as a route handler:"
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 必须只允许管理员访问，而 rewrite 无法认证：它是在你的任何代码运行之前就应用的静态映射。所以 `/pgadmin` "
"是一个应用路由 `apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`，它优先于 "
"`afterFiles` rewrite，在检查调用方之后再代理到 pgAdmin。它的做法适用于任何以 route handler "
"实现的需认证代理："

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:215
msgid ""
"**Fail closed.** `verifyAdmin()` calls `GET /internal/verify-admin` with "
"the caller's cookie and a 5-second timeout, and only an explicit `200` "
"admits. The handler acts as the only guard, because pgAdmin may run "
"without its own login (`PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` set to `False`)."
msgstr ""
"**失败时拒绝。** `verifyAdmin()` 带着调用方的 cookie 以 5 秒超时调用 `GET /internal/verify-"
"admin`，只有明确的 `200` 才放行。handler 把自己当作唯一的守卫，因为 pgAdmin "
"可能没有自己的登录（`PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` 设为 `False`）。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:219
msgid ""
"**Strip the console's session cookie** before forwarding, so the "
"credential never reaches the proxied app."
msgstr "**转发前去掉控制台的会话 cookie**，让这个凭据永远到不了被代理的应用。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:221
msgid ""
"**Drop hop-by-hop headers** (RFC 9110 §7.6.1), plus `host` and `content-"
"length`, which `fetch` derives itself, and drop `content-encoding` on the"
" way back, because `fetch` already decompressed the body. Re-split `Set-"
"Cookie` with `getSetCookie()`, since `Headers.forEach` folds repeated "
"values together."
msgstr ""
"**去掉逐跳头部**（RFC 9110 §7.6.1），以及 `fetch` 会自行推导的 `host` 和 `content-"
"length`；返回时去掉 `content-encoding`，因为 `fetch` 已经解压了响应体。用 `getSetCookie()` "
"重新拆分 `Set-Cookie`，因为 `Headers.forEach` 会把重复的值合并在一起。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:226
msgid ""
"**Keep the app's cookies to the app.** pgAdmin shares the console's "
"origin. `scopeProxiedSetCookie()` drops a cookie named like the console's"
" and confines the rest to `/pgadmin`, without a `Domain`."
msgstr ""
"**让应用的 cookie 只属于该应用。** pgAdmin 与控制台同源。`scopeProxiedSetCookie()` 会丢弃与控制台 "
"cookie 同名的 cookie，并把其余的限定在 `/pgadmin` 下，不设置 `Domain`。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:229
msgid ""
"**Fold upstream-absolute redirects back to paths.** Werkzeug builds "
"absolute redirects from the internal container name, which no browser can"
" resolve; `foldUpstreamRedirect()` rewrites them to paths, matching on "
"the hostname."
msgstr ""
"**把上游的绝对重定向改写回路径。** Werkzeug "
"用内部容器名构建绝对重定向，浏览器无法解析这个名字；`foldUpstreamRedirect()` 按主机名匹配，把它们改写成路径。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:232
msgid ""
"**Redirect with a bare path.** Behind a tunnel the app sees its bind "
"address as `Host`, so an absolute URL would point at "
"`https://0.0.0.0:3001/...`. The handler writes `Location` itself, because"
" `NextResponse.redirect()` accepts only absolute URLs."
msgstr ""
"**用纯路径重定向。** 在隧道后面，应用看到的 `Host` 是自己的绑定地址，所以绝对 URL 会指向 "
"`https://0.0.0.0:3001/...`。handler 自己写 `Location` 头，因为 "
"`NextResponse.redirect()` 只接受绝对 URL。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:237
msgid "The trailing-slash interaction"
msgstr "尾斜杠重定向的冲突"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:239
msgid ""
"`next.config.js` sets `skipTrailingSlashRedirect: true`, because proxied "
"applications own their path semantics. Next removes a trailing slash, "
"pgAdmin (Flask) or the agent web app may add it back, and the two would "
"bounce a browser between them forever. `apps/frontend/src/middleware.ts` "
"redoes the redirect for every path except the `/pgadmin` and `/agents` "
"prefixes: a 308 to the path without the slash, built from `new "
"URL(request.url)`. It avoids `nextUrl.clone()`, which remembers the "
"incoming slash and redirects the request to where it already is."
msgstr ""
"`next.config.js` 设置了 `skipTrailingSlashRedirect: "
"true`，因为被代理的应用自己决定路径语义。Next 会去掉尾斜杠，pgAdmin（Flask）或 agent web "
"应用又可能把它加回来，两者会让浏览器无休止地来回跳转。`apps/frontend/src/middleware.ts` 为除 "
"`/pgadmin` 和 `/agents` 前缀以外的所有路径重新实现这个重定向：以 308 跳到去掉斜杠的路径，用 `new "
"URL(request.url)` 构建。它不使用 `nextUrl.clone()`，因为后者会记住传入的斜杠，把请求重定向到它本来的位置。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:248
msgid ""
"Gateway paths skip the middleware, which would copy their bodies, so "
"`redirects()` in `next.config.js` gives a gateway path that ends in a "
"slash the same `308`, as a bare path. Under the `entry_split` prefixes "
"the gateway gives that answer itself, because a request may reach it "
"without passing the console. Left to Starlette, it would answer `307` "
"with an absolute `Location` built from the `Host` and scheme it saw, "
"which behind a TLS-terminating entry is `http`."
msgstr ""
"网关路径不经过中间件（中间件会复制它们的请求体），所以以斜杠结尾的网关路径由 `next.config.js` 中的 `redirects()` "
"给出同样的 `308`，跳到纯路径。在 `entry_split` 前缀下，网关自己给出同样的应答，因为请求可能不经过控制台就到达网关。如果交给 "
"Starlette，它会返回 `307`，带着根据它看到的 `Host` 和协议构建的绝对 `Location`，而在终止 TLS "
"的入口后面，这个协议是 `http`。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:256
msgid "Adding a public path"
msgstr "新增一条公开路径"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:258
msgid ""
"Add the path to `deploy/public-paths.json`. Mark it `entry_split` only if"
" the deployments that split their entry should send it straight to the "
"gateway; that makes it a new split prefix, and each of them reruns the "
"probe."
msgstr ""
"把路径加到 `deploy/public-paths.json`。只有当拆分入口的部署应该把它直接发给网关时，才把它标记为 "
"`entry_split`；那样它就成了新的分流前缀，这些部署都要重新运行探针。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:262
msgid ""
"Choose the mechanism. A gateway path that takes a request body needs a "
"route handler: a `route.ts` that exports `gatewayRoute('<its prefix>')`, "
"from `src/lib/server/gatewayProxy.ts`, for every method. A path that only"
" answers `GET` may be a static rule in `rewrites()` instead. Write a "
"handler of its own when the target must stay configurable after the "
"build, or when the request needs a check the destination cannot make "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"选择实现方式。带请求体的网关路径需要 route handler：一个为每种方法导出 `gatewayRoute('<its "
"prefix>')`（来自 `src/lib/server/gatewayProxy.ts`）的 `route.ts`。只响应 `GET` "
"的路径也可以改用 `rewrites()` 中的静态规则。当目标在构建后仍需可配置，或请求需要一项目标服务自己做不了的检查时，单独编写一个 "
"handler。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:268
msgid ""
"Name it specifically. Prefer `/prefix/thing` over `/prefix/:path*` unless"
" every current and future route under that prefix is authorized by "
"construction."
msgstr ""
"路径要写具体。优先用 `/prefix/thing`，而不是 "
"`/prefix/:path*`，除非这个前缀下现有和将来的每条路由都从结构上保证了鉴权。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:271
msgid ""
"Rebuild the console. Once that image is deployed, a runtime handler's "
"target can change by recreating the container; a static rewrite target "
"needs another image build."
msgstr "重新构建控制台。该镜像部署之后，运行时 handler 的目标可以通过重建容器来修改；静态 rewrite 的目标则需要再构建一次镜像。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:274
msgid ""
"Add the path to the tables above. The tests under [The manifest](#the-"
"manifest) fail until the manifest, the route files, `next.config.js` and "
"the middleware's `matcher` agree."
msgstr ""
"把路径加到上面的表中。在清单、route 文件、`next.config.js` 和中间件的 `matcher` 一致之前，[清单](#the-"
"manifest)一节中列出的测试都会失败。"

